the form identified as such by the Licensor or, absent such identification,
the preferred form for making modifications.

1.5 "Object Form" means any form of the Licensed Material that is not Source
Form, including forms produced by compilation, rendering, export, generation,
minification, aggregation, or any other mechanical transformation or
translation of Source Form, whether in whole or in part.

1.6 "Derivative Work" means any work — whether in Source Form or Object Form —
that is based upon, derives from, or incorporates a portion of the Licensed
Material, whether verbatim or with modifications, translations, adaptations,
extensions, insertions, deletions, or other changes. A Derivative Work includes
