automatically upon the expiration of that cure period, and You shall cease all
use, reproduction, and Distribution of Licensed Material in Source Form until
such breach is cured. If the breach is cured within the cure period, this
License and the rights granted hereunder shall continue in full force and
effect and shall be deemed never to have terminated by reason of that breach.

11.3 User Works Not Affected — For the avoidance of doubt, no breach of this
License shall be deemed to occur solely by virtue of Your use or Distribution
