incorporate or reproduce Licensed Material in Source Form.

11.4 Effect of Termination — Upon termination, all licenses granted to You
under this License terminate, and Your rights to use, modify, and Distribute
the Licensed Material cease forthwith. Sections 6, 8, 9, 10, 11.4, 11.6, 12,
14, and 15 survive any termination. If You have sublicensed any Derivative
